          transliteration: "La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la shareeka lahu, lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu yuhyee wa yumeetu wa huwa hayyun la yamootu biyadihil-khayru wa huwa 'ala kulli shay'in qadeer.",
